    "Profile: 2D contexts only, alpha true, sRGB, unorm8; other types and settings return RV_ERR_UNSUPPORTED on every provider.",
    "WebKit ignores the alpha setting (FIXME in CanvasRenderingContext2DSettings.idl) and draws a float16 colorType into an 8-bit buffer while reporting float16; the ABI rejects both requests instead of reporting them.",
